        <briefdescription>
<para>Parameters use for a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function_summary" kindref="compound">FunctionSummary</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref> collects access information of all pointer parameters. Information includes a range of direct access of parameters by the functions and all call sites accepting the parameter. StackSafety assumes that missing parameter information means possibility of access to the parameter with any offset, so we can correctly link code without StackSafety information, e.g. non-ThinLTO. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
